msgstr "Gorlak Sürüsü"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:72
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:113
msgid "Merfolk"
msgstr "Susallar"

#. [leader]: id=Nemas, type=Merman Warrior
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:75
msgid "Nemas"
msgstr "Nemas"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:92
msgid "Serpents"
msgstr "Yılanlar"

#. [leader]: id=Shussek, type=Naga Warrior
#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:95
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/11_Crosswind.cfg:462
msgid "Shussek"
msgstr "Şussek"

#. [leader]: id=Poseira, type=Merman Spearman
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:116
msgid "Poseira"
msgstr "Poseira"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:148
msgid "Hold all villages at the end of turn 18"
msgstr "18. elin sonunda bütün köyleri tut"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:152
msgid "Not hold all villages at the end of turn 18"
msgstr "18. elin sonunda bütün köyleri tutamamak"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:167
msgid ""
"You can make the naga allies by moving Resha next to their leader (if you "
"have not killed any of them)"
msgstr ""
"Reşa’yı liderlerinin yanına götürerek nagaları müttefik yapabilirsin "
"(hiçbirini öldürmediysen)"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:170
msgid "Clashers cannot be recruited or recalled"
msgstr "Çarpışanlar askere alınamaz ve geri çağrılamaz"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:173
msgid "It is summer, daytime is longer"
msgstr "Yaz mevsimi, gündüzler daha uzun"

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:184
msgid "Ssssss! Leave our reef, fish imps."
msgstr "Ssssss! Resifimizden defolun, balık ifritleri."

#. [message]: speaker=Poseira
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:188
msgid ""
"Naga interlopers, these isles are now annexed to the realm of Lord Typhon, "
"and by his decree, you are banished from them."
msgstr ""
"Naga davetsizler, bu adalar artık Lord Tayfon’un diyarına katıldı ve onun "
"fermanıyla buralardan sürgün edildiniz."

#. [message]: speaker=Nemas
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:208
msgid "My liege! Drakes have made landfall to your south!"
msgstr "Efendim! Güneyinize ejderler kondu!"

#. [message]: speaker=Poseira
#. By ‘rocks’ he is referring to the Morogor Archipelago in a belittling way.
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:213
msgid "Drakes?! By the gods, how can they be out this far from their rocks?"
msgstr ""
"Ejderler mi?! Tanrılar aşkına, kayalarından bu kadar uzağa nasıl "
"gelebilirler?"

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:219
msgid ""
"Ssssss! What is this? You bring bizarre winged hirelings to our parley... "
"Treachery!"
msgstr ""
"Ssssss! Bu da ne? Görüşmemize tuhaf kanatlı paralı askerler "
"getiriyorsunuz... İhanet!"

#. [message]: speaker=Poseira
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:223
msgid ""
"Naga interlopers, this shall be my final warning to you, depart at once!"
msgstr "Naga davetsizler, bu size son uyarım olacak, hemen ayrılın!"

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:229
msgid ""
"We will ‘de-part’ your fins from you and gulp your fry by the thousands. "
"Ssssss!"
msgstr ""
"Yüzgeçlerinizi sizden ‘ayıracağız’ ve yavrularınızı binlercesini yutacağız. "
"Ssssss!"

#. [message]: speaker=Gorlack
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:233
msgid ""
"Long have the merfolk harried us.\n"
"Now they hinder our journey across their ocean realm."
msgstr ""
"Susallar bizi uzun zamandır taciz ediyor.\n"
"Şimdi de okyanus diyarlarının üzerinden geçen yolculuğumuzu engelliyorlar."

#. [message]: speaker=Resha
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:240
msgid ""
"Without dominion over these shoals, we cannot reprovision.\n"
"\n"
"Yet the flight is direly weary from the journey.\n"
"We should avoid conflict."
msgstr ""
"Bu sığlıklara hâkim olmadan yeniden erzak alamayız.\n"
"\n"
"Ama sürü yolculuktan fena halde yorgun.\n"
"Çatışmadan kaçınmalıyız."

#. [message]: speaker=Gorlack
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:247
msgid ""
"We outmatch them.\n"
"We shall overcome them as so we always have."
msgstr ""
"Onlardan üstünüz.\n"
"Her zaman yaptığımız gibi onların üstesinden geleceğiz."

#. [message]: speaker=Resha
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:254
msgid ""
"If that is your will.\n"
"Yet pray first recall the folly of Dominant Morogor at the Battle of the "
"Crystal Sea."
msgstr ""
"İraden buysa.\n"
"Ama önce lütfen Kristal Deniz Savaşı’nda Hükümran Morogor’un akılsızlığını "
"hatırla."

#. [message]: speaker=Gorlack
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:259
msgid ""
"... You speak true, Resha.\n"
"\n"
"We must repeat not the ancient mistakes."
msgstr ""
"... Doğru söylüyorsun, Reşa.\n"
"\n"
"Kadim hataları tekrarlamamalıyız."

#. [message]: speaker=Gorlack
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:265
msgid ""
"I shall allow a sojourn of three days.\n"
"The whole of the flight will rest.\n"
"Except for we that are strongest of wing...\n"
"\n"
"We shall harass the sea devils whenever they offer the chance.\n"
"By the third day’s end, we must hold all their settlements.\n"
"For from those shall we, all at once, carry away <i>their</i> provisions "
"with our rested flight."
msgstr ""
"Üç günlük bir mola vereceğim.\n"
"Bütün sürü dinlenecek.\n"
"Kanadı en güçlü olan bizler hariç...\n"
"\n"
"Deniz şeytanlarını fırsat verdikçe taciz edeceğiz.\n"
"Üçüncü günün sonunda bütün yerleşimlerini tutmalıyız.\n"
"Çünkü onlardan, dinlenmiş sürümüzle hep birlikte <i>onların</i> erzakını "
"taşıyacağız."

#. [message]: speaker=Resha
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:277
msgid "We might also forge a truce with the serpents."
msgstr "Yılanlarla da bir ateşkes yapabiliriz."

#. [message]: speaker=Gorlack
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:281
msgid "A truce with prey..."
msgstr "Avla ateşkes..."

#. [message]: speaker=Resha
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:287
msgid ""
"Grant me your trust, for alien possibilities exist in this wider world.\n"
"\n"
"If we slay none of these serpents, I might turn their leader to our side.\n"
"Yet I must get close enough to grasp the strange words it speaks.\n"
"\n"
"Otherwise, having not summoned us here, they will assume us allies of the "
"merfolk."
msgstr ""
"Bana güven, çünkü bu daha geniş dünyada yabancı olasılıklar var.\n"
"\n"
"Bu yılanlardan hiçbirini öldürmezsek liderlerini bizim tarafımıza "
"çekebilirim.\n"
"Ama konuştuğu tuhaf sözleri kavrayacak kadar yaklaşmalıyım.\n"
"\n"
"Aksi halde, onlar bizi buraya çağırmadığı için bizi susalların müttefiki "
"sanacaklar."

#. [message]: speaker=Gorlack
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:296
msgid "I shall consider this."
msgstr "Bunu düşüneceğim."

#. [message]: speaker=Nemas
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:306
msgid "My liege, permission to engage the drakes?"
msgstr "Efendim, ejderlerle çatışmak için izin?"

#. [message]: speaker=Poseira
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:310
msgid "Permission denied. Stay on your keep and let your forces engage them."
msgstr ""
"İzin verilmedi. Burcunda kal ve güçlerinin onlarla çatışmasına izin ver."

#. [message]: speaker=Nemas
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:316
msgid ""
"With all due respect, sir, I am no coward. My father always led from the "
"front and his fighters respected him for it."
msgstr ""
"Kusura bakmayın efendim, ben korkak değilim. Babam her zaman en önden "
"önderlik ederdi ve savaşçıları ona bunun için saygı duyardı."

#. [message]: speaker=Poseira
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:320
msgid ""
"Remain at your post, Nemas, that is an order.\n"
"\n"
"I have something special planned to turn the tides in our favor."
msgstr ""
"Görevinde kal, Nemas, bu bir emir.\n"
"\n"
"Gidişatı lehimize çevirecek özel bir planım var."

#. [message]: speaker=Resha
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:327
msgid ""
"Strange waves circle the northernmost shoals.\n"
"I fear the northern mermish plan to unleash monsters from the deep."
msgstr ""
"En kuzeydeki sığlıkların etrafında tuhaf dalgalar dönüyor.\n"
"Korkarım kuzeydeki susallar derinliklerden canavarlar salmayı planlıyor."

#. [message]: speaker=Gorlack
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:332
msgid "Slaying their leader will halt their doing so."
msgstr "Liderlerini öldürmek bunu yapmalarını durdurur."

#. [message]: speaker=Resha
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:336
msgid ""
"That might spread us too thin.\n"
"I must advise against it."
msgstr ""
"Bu bizi fazla dağıtabilir.\n"
"Karşı çıkmam gerekir."

#. [message]: speaker=Nemas
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:350
msgid "Advance!"
msgstr "İlerleyin!"

#. [message]: speaker=Poseira
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:354
msgid "Nemas, you are violating a direct order! Return to your keep at once!"
msgstr "Nemas, doğrudan bir emri çiğniyorsun! Hemen burcuna dön!"

#. [message]: speaker=Poseira
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:362
msgid "Release the Kraken!"
msgstr "Krakeni salın!"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:380
msgid "Slimysuckers"
msgstr "Yapışkanvantuz"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:381
msgid "Glarbelblarg!"
msgstr "Glarbelblarg!"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:386
msgid "Creepytentacles"
msgstr "Ürkünçdokunaç"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:387
msgid "Shluckplugle!"
msgstr "Şlukpluğıl!"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:392
msgid "Largeeyes"
msgstr "İrigöz"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:393
msgid "Glarpglup!"
msgstr "Glarpglup!"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:398
msgid "Stinkinink"
msgstr "Kokarmürekkep"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:399
msgid "(<i>burp</i>)"
msgstr "(<i>geğirir</i>)"

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:430
msgid "Behold your doom!"
msgstr "Kıyametinizi görün!"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:448
msgid "Sharpspikes"
msgstr "Sivridiken"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:449
msgid "Graarrrrrr!"
msgstr "Graarrrrrr!"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:454
msgid "Shinyscales"
msgstr "Parlakpul"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:455
msgid "Roarrrrrr!"
msgstr "Roarrrrrr!"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:460
msgid "Longtooth"
msgstr "Uzundiş"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:461
msgid "Hissssss!"
msgstr "Hısssss!"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:466
msgid "Razorfin"
msgstr "Jiletyüzgeç"

#. [case]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:467
msgid "(<i>cough</i>) ...rawr"
msgstr "(<i>öksürür</i>) ...rawr"

#. [message]: speaker=Resha
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:524
msgid "We seek an ally against these fiendish merfolk."
msgstr "Bu şeytani susallara karşı bir müttefik arıyoruz."

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:530
msgid "Ssssss? You will betray merfolk?"
msgstr "Ssssss? Susallara ihanet edecek misin?"

#. [message]: speaker=Resha
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:534
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:572
msgid "... Yes."
msgstr "... Evet."

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:540
msgid "And then you take this reef from us? Ssssss!"
msgstr "Sonra bu resifi bizden mi alacaksınız? Ssssss!"

#. [message]: speaker=Resha
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:544
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:582
msgid ""
"We seek a right to respite here for those of our kind traveling past these "
"isles."
msgstr ""
"Bu adaların yanından geçen türümüzden olanlar için burada dinlenme hakkı "
"istiyoruz."

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:550
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:588
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/11_Crosswind.cfg:473
msgid "What you say?"
msgstr "Ne dedin?"

#. [message]: speaker=Resha
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:554
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:592
msgid ""
"...... We have no need of your reef. We seek only the land above the sea."
msgstr ""
"...... Resifinize ihtiyacımız yok. Yalnızca denizin üstündeki karayı "
"istiyoruz."

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:560
msgid "You have a deal, sky monster. Merfolk will float dead on the waves!"
msgstr "Anlaştık, gök canavarı. Susallar dalgalarda ölü yüzecek!"

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:568
msgid "Ssssss? You have betrayed merfolk?"
msgstr "Ssssss? Susallara ihanet ettin mi?"

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:578
msgid "And now you take this reef from us? Ssssss!"
msgstr "Ve şimdi bu resifi bizden alacak mısınız? Ssssss!"

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:598
msgid "So be it, sky monster."
msgstr "Öyle olsun, gök canavarı."

#. [message]: speaker=Shussek
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:624
msgid "Ssssss!"
msgstr "Ssssss!"

#. [message]: speaker=Resha
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:671
msgid ""
"All provisions are gathered; the flight is readied for departure, awaiting "
"your command."
msgstr "Bütün erzak toplandı; sürü ayrılmaya hazır, emrini bekliyor."

#. [message]: speaker=Gorlack
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/04_Journey.cfg:675
msgid ""
"It is given.\n"
"\n"
"Take wing!"
msgstr ""
"Emir verildi.\n"
"\n"
"Kanatlanın!"

#. [scenario]: id=05_Threshold
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:5
msgid "Threshold"
msgstr "Eşik"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Gliders were dispatched back to Morogor with exacting details of the petty "
"atoll’s location. The flight resumed its journey east."
msgstr ""
"Küçük mercan adasının yerinin kesin ayrıntılarıyla planörcüler Morogor’a "
"geri gönderildi. Sürü doğuya yolculuğuna devam etti."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:22
msgid ""
"The familiar rhythm of the long journey began anew. The aching of wings "
"slowly returned."
msgstr ""
"Uzun yolculuğun tanıdık ritmi yeniden başladı. Kanat ağrıları yavaş yavaş "
"geri döndü."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:25
msgid ""
"Then Gorlack, scouting far ahead with the forward wing, sighted it. Land as "
"great as the ocean. The land without end."
msgstr ""
"Sonra öncü kanatla çok ileride keşif yapan Gorlak onu gördü. Okyanus kadar "
"büyük bir kara. Sonu olmayan kara."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:29
msgid ""
"Resha persuaded Gorlack to make first landfall upon a nearby cluster of "
"three isles. Here a narrow sea warded against the unknown perils of the "
"Greatland."
msgstr ""
"Reşa, Gorlak’ı ilk inişi yakındaki üç adalık bir kümeye yapmaya ikna etti. "
"Burada dar bir deniz Büyük Diyar’ın bilinmeyen tehlikelerine karşı koruma "
"sağlıyordu."

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:40
msgid "Forward Wing"
msgstr "Öncü Kanat"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:66
msgid "Haldric Creatures"
msgstr "Haldrik Yaratıkları"

#. [leader]: id=Rhynnin, type=Lieutenant
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:73
msgid "Rhynnin"
msgstr "Rinnin"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:82
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:102
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:130
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:163
msgid "Elyn"
msgstr "Elin"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:93
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:118
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:148
#: data/campaigns/Winds_of_Fate/scenarios/05_Threshold.cfg:181
